// ---- feature flags (verdict 003; household ADR-0004 is the first user) ----
// One document of switches the app reads to turn a V2 capability off without
// a migration. Any signed-in caller may read it — it says what the app
// offers, which is no secret — and no client may write it; it is changed in
// the console or by an admin tool.
match /appConfig/{documentId} {
  allow read: if isSignedIn();
  allow write: if false;
}
